<title>NETHERLANDS: Fortis reveals hidden reserves of 192 mln ECU.</title>
<headline>Fortis reveals hidden reserves of 192 mln ECU.</headline>
<dateline>UTRECHT, Netherlands 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch-Belgian financial services group Fortis revealed on Wednesday that its Dutch banking operations had hidden reserves of 192 million European currency units (ECU) at the end of 1996.</p>
<p>Dutch banks have been ordered to disclose their hidden reserves by the year 2000 to comply with European Union rules.</p>
<p>Co-chairman Hans Bartelds told reporters that the group's Belgian banking operations would reveal their hidden reserves next year.</p>
<p>-- Wendy Braanker, +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
